two_dice.plain, line 1: Add brackets to show which numbers go together.

    set roll to a random number from 1 to 6 plus a random number from 1 to 6
                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Try one of these:
    set roll to (a random number from 1 to 6) plus a random number from 1 to 6
  or
    set roll to a random number from 1 to (6 plus a random number from 1 to 6)
Why: Plain can read this two ways: the plus could belong to the last number of "a random number from …", or come after it.

